{"id":"1c72ded1a1c9a9de","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/626_间隔模态逻辑.md","title":"626 间隔模态逻辑","display":"626_间隔模态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}=\\{B,E,D,O,A,L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}=\\{B,E,D,O,A,L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\\)</span> 的元素是间隔关系标签，不是语义关系。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{dia}_R\\ (R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{dia}_R\\ (R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle R\\rangle A=\\operatorname{dia}_R(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle R\\rangle A=\\operatorname{dia}_R(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[R]A=\\neg\\langle R\\rangle\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[R]A=\\neg\\langle R\\rangle\\neg A,\\quad\n\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义间隔标签反演函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}_{I}:\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\\to\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{inv}_{I}:\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\\to\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(B)=E,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(E)=B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(D)=D,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(B)=E,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(E)=B,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(D)=D,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(O)=O,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(A)=L,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(L)=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(O)=O,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(A)=L,\\quad\n\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(L)=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{-1}\">\\(R^{-1}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(R)\">\\(\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(R)\\)</span>。它只是对象语言索引上的函数，不是外部区间关系的语义逆关系。</p>\n<p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R\\rangle A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(\\langle R\\rangle A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{626}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{626}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{626}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{626}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{626}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{626}(A)=\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{626}(A)=\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{626}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{626}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{626}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{626}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{626}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{626}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{626}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{626}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{626}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{626}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\langle R\\rangle\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\langle R\\rangle A)=\\langle R\\rangle\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,626}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,626}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{626}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{626}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{626}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{626}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{626}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{626}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>各间隔关系的正规公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{626}\n=\n\\{[R](A\\to B)\\to([R]A\\to[R]B):R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{626}\n=\n\\{[R](A\\to B)\\to([R]A\\to[R]B):R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\ A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>关系逆向配对公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{626}\n=\n\\{A\\to [R]\\langle R^{-1}\\rangle A:R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{626}\n=\n\\{A\\to [R]\\langle R^{-1}\\rangle A:R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{626}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{626}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{626}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K_R}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Inv}^{626}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{626}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{626}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{626}\n=\n\\{((A),[R]A):R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{626}\n=\n\\{((A),[R]A):R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\ A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{626}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{626}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{626}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{626}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{626}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{626}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{626}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的集合，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad m&gt;0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma),\\quad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma),\\quad A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 至少满足下列一种行类型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7.1-假设行\">7.1 假设行</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\Gamma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.2-公理行\">7.2 公理行</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{626}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{626}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.3-分离规则行\">7.3 分离规则行</h2>\n<p>存在</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j,k&lt;i\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{626},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{626},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价地存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_j=B,\\quad A_k=B\\to A_i,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_j=B,\\quad A_k=B\\to A_i,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.4-间隔必然化规则行\">7.4 间隔必然化规则行</h2>\n<p>存在</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j&lt;i\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{626},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecR}^{626},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价地存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i=[R]A_j,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i=[R]A_j,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且该规则只作用于无依赖前提：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\varnothing,\\quad \\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_j=\\varnothing,\\quad \\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{626}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{626}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{626}(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{626}(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_{m-1}=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{626}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{626}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{626}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{626}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-区间结构语义\">9. 区间结构语义</h1>\n<p>间隔模型为四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(T,\\le,V,(\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M})_{R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}})\\in\\mathsf{IMod}_{626},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(T,\\le,V,(\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M})_{R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}})\\in\\mathsf{IMod}_{626},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\le)\">\\((T,\\le)\\)</span> 是非空预序，区间集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)=\\{(x,y)\\in T\\times T:x\\le y\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)=\\{(x,y)\\in T\\times T:x\\le y\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T))\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T))\\)</span>。每个关系标签解释为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq \\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\subseteq \\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\times\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且满足反演约束</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(R)}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{(J,I):(I,J)\\in\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_{\\operatorname{inv}_{I}(R)}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{(J,I):(I,J)\\in\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{IMod}_{626}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{IMod}_{626}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{626}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}=\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}=\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\langle R\\rangle A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T):\\exists J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\ ((I,J)\\in\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\land J\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\langle R\\rangle A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T):\\exists J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\ ((I,J)\\in\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\land J\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[R]A\">\\([R]A\\)</span> 作为缩写出现，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket [R]A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T):\\forall J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\ ((I,J)\\in\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\Rightarrow J\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket [R]A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T):\\forall J\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\ ((I,J)\\in\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M}\\Rightarrow J\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,I\\Vdash_{626}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,I\\Vdash_{626}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nI\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{626}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{626}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(T,\\le,V,(\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M})_{R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}})\\in\\mathsf{IMod}_{626}\\ \\forall I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,I\\Vdash_{626}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,I\\Vdash_{626}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{626}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(T,\\le,V,(\\mathcal R_R^{\\mathcal M})_{R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}})\\in\\mathsf{IMod}_{626}\\ \\forall I\\in\\mathsf{Int}_{626}(T)\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,I\\Vdash_{626}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,I\\Vdash_{626}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统的目标差异是关系标签集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}\\)</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的模态构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle R\\rangle\">\\(\\langle R\\rangle\\)</span>，以及反演函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\mapsto R^{-1}\">\\(R\\mapsto R^{-1}\\)</span>。第 9 节把这些标签解释为区间之间的二元关系，并要求反演标签解释为逆关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{IML}_{626}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\operatorname{inv}_{I},\\mathsf{Frm}_{626},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{626},\\operatorname{BV}_{626},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{626},\\operatorname{Sub}_{626},\\equiv_{\\alpha,626},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{626},\\mathsf{Rule}_{626},\\mathsf{Proof}_{626},\\vdash_{626},\\mathsf{Thm}_{626},\n\\mathsf{IMod}_{626},\\mathsf{Int}_{626},(\\mathcal R_R)_{R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{626},\\Vdash_{626},\\models_{626}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{IML}_{626}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Rel}_{I},\\operatorname{inv}_{I},\\mathsf{Frm}_{626},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{626},\\operatorname{BV}_{626},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{626},\\operatorname{Sub}_{626},\\equiv_{\\alpha,626},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{626},\\mathsf{Rule}_{626},\\mathsf{Proof}_{626},\\vdash_{626},\\mathsf{Thm}_{626},\n\\mathsf{IMod}_{626},\\mathsf{Int}_{626},(\\mathcal R_R)_{R\\in\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{626},\\Vdash_{626},\\models_{626}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由间隔关系索引的模态句法、公理、证明关系以及区间结构语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>本条目不在此处断言可靠性、完备性、区间模型检查或算法实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.1-假设行","text":"7.1 假设行","level":2},{"id":"7.2-公理行","text":"7.2 公理行","level":2},{"id":"7.3-分离规则行","text":"7.3 分离规则行","level":2},{"id":"7.4-间隔必然化规则行","text":"7.4 间隔必然化规则行","level":2},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-区间结构语义","text":"9. 区间结构语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}=\\{B,E,D,O,A,L\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rel}_{I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad